<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (In anticipation of hosting major global sporting events like the Africa Cup of Nations and the World Cup, Morocco stands on the precipice of a transformative opportunity to showcase its prowess on the international stage. As the country gears up to welcome a significant influx of visitors, particularly in urban hubs like Casablanca, the need to effectively manage transportation and alleviate traffic congestion becomes increasingly pressing.)
/E (In anticipation of hosting major global sporting events like the Africa Cup of Nations and the World Cup, Morocco stands on the precipice of a transformative opportunity to showcase its prowess on the international stage. As the country gears up to welcome a significant influx of visitors, particularly in urban hubs like Casablanca, the need to effectively manage transportation and alleviate traffic congestion becomes increasingly pressing.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
374 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The sprawling metropolis of Casablanca, already grappling with urban mobility challenges, faces the daunting task of accommodating the surge in vehicular and pedestrian traffic expected during these high-profile events. The potential for gridlock and logistical bottlenecks looms large, threatening to mar the visitor experience and undermine Morocco's image as a capable host.)
