/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Cities face a major parking problem, with the most popular areas experiencing ever-increasing demand for parking. Parking is not only for local residents but for everyone, and the duration of parking is not specific, which causes problems. Despite the presence of parking lots, many accidents and issues occur among drivers. To reduce these problems, one solution is smart parking. It reduces issues by helping tourists, employees, or anyone unfamiliar with the city to easily and reliably reserve a parking space for their vehicle.)
/E (Cities face a major parking problem, with the most popular areas experiencing ever-increasing demand for parking. Parking is not only for local residents but for everyone, and the duration of parking is not specific, which causes problems. Despite the presence of parking lots, many accidents and issues occur among drivers. To reduce these problems, one solution is smart parking. It reduces issues by helping tourists, employees, or anyone unfamiliar with the city to easily and reliably reserve a parking space for their vehicle.)
