459 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1086 0 R
/ActualText (Less stress for drivers. Trying to find an available parking space can become an exercise in frustration. But smart detectors and cameras installed at a parking lot and connected to a cloud server can solve the problem. If you can readily see that all spaces are occupied, you can just look for another parking area. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
460 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1087 0 R
/ActualText (Fuel and time savings. Apps give car owners a clear understanding of where they can find a parking space and the chance to book it in advance. This means less wasted time and fuel spent driving around looking for a parking spot.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
461 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1088 0 R
/ActualText (Informed parking management decisions. The possibility of monitoring the situation at a parking lot remotely is also beneficial for operators, who can build more efficient business strategies and make better decisions about whether to close a parking garage or open a new one in a particular zone. This means city authorities and businesses can make smarter investments in organizing parking areas and optimize their budget allocations.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [5]
>>
