/T (    Conclusion  The selection of materials was the most delicate phase in our project. It not only involved purely technical aspects meeting functional requirements but also addressed user preferences within a specific market context. Overall, the choice of materials was analyzed from the perspective of materials engineering, response time, not to mention the aesthetic aspect \(industrial design\).)
/E (    Conclusion  The selection of materials was the most delicate phase in our project. It not only involved purely technical aspects meeting functional requirements but also addressed user preferences within a specific market context. Overall, the choice of materials was analyzed from the perspective of materials engineering, response time, not to mention the aesthetic aspect \(industrial design\).)
