/T (1. Interface Design: The interface design of our smart parking website serves as the first point of contact for users, setting the tone for their interaction with the platform. Our interface features a modern and intuitive design aesthetic, characterized by clean layouts, vibrant colors, and clear typography. The interface is visually appealing and user-friendly, creating a welcoming environment for users to explore and interact with our smart parking system.)
