/T (2. Sign-Up Feature: The sign-up feature of our smart parking website plays a crucial role in providing personalized services to users and facilitating access to the reservation system. Users are required to register on the platform to access advanced features, including booking parking spots in advance. The registration process is streamlined and user-friendly, requiring users to provide essential information such as name, email address, and password. To ensure the security of user data, robust security measures such as encryption and secure authentication protocols have been implemented.)
/E (2. Sign-Up Feature: The sign-up feature of our smart parking website plays a crucial role in providing personalized services to users and facilitating access to the reservation system. Users are required to register on the platform to access advanced features, including booking parking spots in advance. The registration process is streamlined and user-friendly, requiring users to provide essential information such as name, email address, and password. To ensure the security of user data, robust security measures such as encryption and secure authentication protocols have been implemented.)
