/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Our application provides an efficient and user-friendly solution for managing parking spaces in urban environments. By integrating ultrasonic sensors, servo motors, LEDs, and an ESP32 microcontroller, we have created a smart parking system that accurately detects the presence of vehicles, controls parking access barriers, and provides real-time status updates to users. With the help of a visually intuitive website interface, drivers can easily locate available parking spaces and reserve them in advance, reducing congestion and optimizing parking space utilization. The final result is a comprehensive smart parking solution that enhances the parking experience for both drivers and administrators, contributing to improved traffic flow and urban mobility.)
/E (Our application provides an efficient and user-friendly solution for managing parking spaces in urban environments. By integrating ultrasonic sensors, servo motors, LEDs, and an ESP32 microcontroller, we have created a smart parking system that accurately detects the presence of vehicles, controls parking access barriers, and provides real-time status updates to users. With the help of a visually intuitive website interface, drivers can easily locate available parking spaces and reserve them in advance, reducing congestion and optimizing parking space utilization. The final result is a comprehensive smart parking solution that enhances the parking experience for both drivers and administrators, contributing to improved traffic flow and urban mobility.)
/Pg 49 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
